OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway reopens after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M6 motorway was shut in the West
OL,7,FMidlands on Saturday after a van fire
OL,8,Fand "significant diesel spillage"
OL,9,Fcaused significant delays, National
OL,10,FHighways said.
OL,12,FAll lanes were closed for more than two
OL,13,Fhours on the southbound side of the
OL,14,Fcarriageway between junction six for
OL,15,FGravelly Hill Interchange, known as
OL,16,FSpaghetti Junction, and junction five
OL,17,Fnear Castle Bromwich from around 16:00
OL,18,FGMT.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
