OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway reopens after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,7,Fwith contractors to assess the road
OL,8,Fsurface and recover the vehicle before
OL,9,Ftwo lanes were reopened at about 18:30.
OL,11,FMotorists were advised to follow
OL,12,Fdiversion routes via the A45127
OL,13,Fsouthbound and A47 eastbound to join
OL,14,Fthe motorway after junction five.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
